    "body": "Clang recently enabled `-Wunused-template` under `-Wall` (see https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project/pull/208001). This change enables the diagnostic for older Clang versions as well, notably those used in the CI.\r\n\r\nThe minisketch subtree is exempted until it includes the upstream fix from https://github.com/bitcoin-core/minisketch/pull/102.",
